    "notes": {
        "79ec9fa8-ee2e-4b3e-b68d-40be1b59933d": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 448,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 200,
            "content": "## Test hook\n\nCalls `appmixer-echo` on the OpenClaw gateway of the account. That hook runs no agent: its transform posts a progress update (`\"final\": false`) and then the received payload (`\"status\": \"passed\"`) to the Call Hook callback URL, so Out, Progress and Done all fire within seconds.\n\nOn another gateway, deploy `.github/openclaw/appmixer-echo/` of Appmixer-ai/appmixer-components (transform + mapping + proxy location) first.\n\nThe flow also serves the pipeline dry run of Appmixer-ai/appmixer-components#3009."
        }
